      "assistant_text": "Now I can see the connection clearly. Let me think about whether this warrants a synthesis page.\n\nBoth pages describe **single points of control** for their respective concerns:\n- **Credential-scoping** centralizes the *injection* of secrets into child processes at spawn time\n- **Runtime-paths** centralizes the *resolution* of all file-system locations at startup\n\nThe connection is that both are applying the same architectural principle \u2014 **single composition point** \u2014 but to different resource types. Neither page explicitly states this broader pattern, so this is a genuine synthesis that could be valuable.\n\nLet me create a synthesis page and update the index and log:",
